<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Союз продакшен — Официальный архив</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0a0a0b;
            --card-bg: #161618;
            --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffcc00, #ff4500);
            --text-color: #f5f5f7;
            --secondary-text: #a1a1a6;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1c1c1e 0%, #0a0a0b 100%);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 15px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .video-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        /* Стиль карточки-ссылки */
        .video-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: block;
        }

        .video-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #2c2c2e;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            position: relative;
        }

        .video-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: #ffcc00;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }

        /* Заглушка под превью (пока нет картинки) */
        .preview-holder {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .preview-holder img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* Кнопка Play поверх превью */
        .play-btn {
            position: absolute;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.9);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .video-card:hover .play-btn {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .video-info {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .video-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .video-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
        }

        .badge {
            background: #2c2c2e;
            color: #ffcc00;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #2c2c2e;
            margin-top: 80px;
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .tg-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: #24A1DE;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .tg-button:hover { background: #1c82b3; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Союз продакшен</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Архив легендарных озвучек</div>
    <a href="https://t.me/souz_prodaksen" class="tg-button">Наш Telegram</a>
</header>

<div class="container">
    <div class="video-grid">

        <a href="video1.html" class="video-link">
            <div class="video-card">
                <div class="preview-holder">
                    <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/dQw4w9WgXcQ/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Превью">
                    <div class="play-btn">▶️</div>
                </div>
                <div class="video-info">
                    <div class="video-title">Дубляж Союза Продакшен - Плохой маскот</div>
                    <div class="video-footer">
                        <span>Апрель 2026</span>
                        <span class="badge">Смотреть</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="video2.html" class="video-link">
            <div class="video-card">
                <div class="preview-holder">
                    <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/3JZ_D3ELwOQ/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Превью">
                    <div class="play-btn">▶️</div>
                </div>
                <div class="video-info">
                    <div class="video-title">Второй мемный шедевр</div>
                    <div class="video-footer">
                        <span>Март 2026</span>
                        <span class="badge">Смотреть</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>

    </div>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Союз продакшен. Сделано по красоте.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
